Having considered that the petitioner has been implicated in the present case for allegation to commit sexual intercourse with prosecutrix, on the pretext of entering into marriage; prosecutrix is a major girl of 30 years and in her statements, she admits to have acquaintance with petitioner since 5 years and to live with him in live-in relationship, on an understanding to enter into marriage;
petitioner is in custody since 19.10.2025, having no criminal antecedents, but without commenting on merits of the (Uploaded on 06/12/2025 at 11:33:53 AM) [2025:RJ-JD:52458] (2 of 2)
[CRLMB-13833/2025] case, this Court deems it just and proper to release the petitioner on bail.
